		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Noble, nearly naked horned fey with a long spear and a golden hunting horn. Leads the Wild Hunt.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 62, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 +3 spear (close/near) +8 (1d6+3) or summon <strong>W</strong>ild Hunt, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Reincarnation</strong>. Reincarnate mortal slain by the Hunt as a Wild Hunt creature.</p><p></p><p><strong>Summon Wild Hunt</strong>. Blow horn, summoning 2d6 Wild Hunt creatures from Faerie, arrive in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Wild Hunt</strong>. If slain, spear turns to vines and mud.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
